722	  // Use JSON.stringify to produce a collision-resistant key.
723	  // Previous format used `:` and `=` delimiters without escaping, which
724	  // allowed different header sets to produce identical keys (e.g.
725	  // {a:"x:b=y"} vs {a:"x", b:"y"}). See: https://github.com/nodejs/undici/issues/5012
